@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN
@profileId = 1
@fieldId = 1
@deviceId = 1
@readingId = 1

### Registro (cambiar correo para una nueva cuenta; repetir produce 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/authentication/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Ana Torres","emailAddress":"ana@example.test","password":"cambiar-para-demo","confirmPassword":"cambiar-para-demo"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/authentication/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{"emailAddress":"ana@example.test","password":"cambiar-para-demo"}

### Cuenta propia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Perfil propio (404 antes de completarlo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Completar perfil; copiar id devuelto en profileId
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Ana Torres","fundoName":"Fundo Norte","contactPhone":"999888777","location":"Huaral, Lima","sizeM2":10000}

### Parcela; copiar id devuelto en fieldId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"profileId":{{profileId}},"name":"Parcela Norte","sizeM2":5000,"soilType":"Franco","latitude":-11.5,"longitude":-77.2,"cropName":"Papa"}

### Parcelas propias
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ejecutar --demo-catalog antes. Copiar id devuelto en deviceId.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/register
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorCode":"TT-ZZZ001","fieldId":{{fieldId}},"name":"Sensor Norte"}

### Sensores de la parcela propia
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fields/{{fieldId}}/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sin datos: 404 NO_READINGS; ejecutar --demo-readings --device-id <id> y repetir
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/readings/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Histórico 7 días
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/readings?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Histórico 30 días
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/readings?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Perfil legado: los campos snake_case permanecen
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles/{{profileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fundo_name":"Fundo Norte","contact_phone":"999888777","moisture_threshold":30,"temp_threshold":35}

### Detalle: copiar un id de lectura del histórico en readingId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/readings/{{readingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
